msgid "Debugging Sim-to-Real Issues"
msgstr "Sim-to-Real 문제 Debugging"

msgid ""
"Overlaid wrist-camera views showing differences in rack holes, vial cap, and gripper alignment "
"between simulation and reality."
msgstr "Simulation과 실제 wrist camera view를 겹쳐 rack hole, vial cap, gripper 정렬 차이를 보여줍니다."

msgid ""
"These checks come from this workshop's SO-101 vial-to-rack case study. They are useful hypotheses"
" to test, but the causes and fixes may differ for another robot, task, policy, or environment."
msgstr ""
"이 점검 항목은 workshop의 SO-101 vial-to-rack 사례에서 얻었습니다. 검증할 가설로 유용하지만 다른 robot, task, policy, "
"environment에서는 원인과 해결 방법이 달라질 수 있습니다."

msgid "Verify the robot configuration and mechanical condition."
msgstr "Robot 구성과 기계 상태 확인"

msgid ""
"Check the follower's calibration, homing offsets, joint order and units, measured position, and "
"gripper mapping. Confirm that the achieved pose matches the commanded pose before blaming the "
"policy. On the SO-101, fasteners can loosen over time as the printed plastic compresses, and "
"servos can wear after heavy use. Inspect the joints and mounts, then use basic teleoperation or a"
" known-good replay to confirm that the robot moves accurately and consistently. See "
"[Calibration](07-calibrating-so101.md) for the workshop procedure."
msgstr ""
"Follower calibration, homing offset, joint 순서와 단위, 측정 position, gripper mapping을 확인하세요. Policy를 "
"의심하기 전에 실제 pose와 명령한 pose가 일치하는지 검증합니다. SO-101은 출력된 plastic의 압축으로 fastener가 느슨해질 수 있고, 사용량이 많으면 "
"servo가 마모될 수 있습니다. Joint와 mount를 점검한 뒤 기본 teleoperation이나 검증된 replay로 정확하고 일관되게 움직이는지 확인하세요. 절차는 "
"[Calibration](07-calibrating-so101.md)을 참고하세요."

msgid "Inspect the complete camera pipeline"
msgstr "전체 Camera Pipeline 점검"

msgid ""
"Check focus and alignment, tighten loose camera mounts and nuts, and confirm that each physical "
"camera maps to the feature name expected by the checkpoint. When more than one camera is present,"
" make sure they have not been swapped. Confirm that captured frames remain fresh and sustain the "
"requested frame rate; a responsive preview alone does not prove that the policy receives every "
"frame on time."
msgstr ""
"Focus와 alignment를 확인하고 느슨한 camera mount와 nut를 조이세요. 각 physical camera가 checkpoint가 기대하는 feature "
"name에 연결되고 서로 바뀌지 않았는지 확인합니다. Capture frame이 최신 상태로 요청 frame rate를 유지하는지도 확인하세요. Preview가 반응한다고 "
"policy가 모든 frame을 제때 받는다는 뜻은 아닙니다."

msgid "Look for learned position bias."
msgstr "학습된 Position Bias 확인"

msgid ""
"If the arm reaches toward a place where no object exists, the policy may be relying on a narrow "
"set of familiar object positions instead of the current image. Compare predictions while changing"
" only the object's position, then inspect whether the training data covers those layouts. Treat "
"overfitting as a hypothesis until a controlled test supports it."
msgstr ""
"물체가 없는 곳으로 arm이 향한다면 현재 image 대신 익숙한 object 위치에 의존할 수 있습니다. Object 위치만 바꾸며 prediction을 비교하고 "
"training data가 그 배치를 포함하는지 확인하세요. 통제된 시험으로 뒷받침되기 전까지 overfitting은 가설로 다룹니다."

msgid "Match the training-data starting pose."
msgstr "Training Data의 Starting Pose 맞추기"

msgid ""
"If the robot hesitates or does not begin the task, check whether its achieved start lies inside "
"the checkpoint's actual training-start distribution. In this SO-101 vial-to-rack case study, "
"moving the robot to a represented start was essential for the best observed policy performance. "
"Account for the current calibration and any continuation or teleoperation data."
msgstr ""
"Robot이 머뭇거리거나 시작하지 않으면 실제 도달한 시작 pose가 checkpoint의 training-start distribution 안에 있는지 확인하세요. 이 "
"SO-101 사례에서는 data에 있는 시작 pose로 이동하는 것이 최상의 관측 성능에 필수적이었습니다. 현재 calibration과 continuation 또는 "
"teleoperation data도 고려하세요."

msgid "Compare visual conditions."
msgstr "시각적 조건 비교"

msgid ""
"For a vision-language-action policy, check whether lighting, shadows, reflections, backgrounds, "
"materials, exposure, or camera response fall outside the training distribution. Hold the pose and"
" layout fixed while changing one visual factor at a time."
msgstr ""
"Vision-Language-Action policy에서는 lighting, shadow, reflection, background, material, exposure, "
"camera response가 training distribution 밖인지 확인합니다. Pose와 배치는 고정하고 시각적 요인을 하나씩 바꾸세요."

msgid "Replay a known-good physical episode."
msgstr "검증된 실제 Episode Replay"

msgid ""
"Replay an episode collected on the same robot to check whether its recorded commands still "
"reproduce the task. This bypasses policy prediction and can reveal coarse calibration, joint-"
"mapping, gripper, timing, or actuator problems. Follow the [recorded-episode replay "
"procedure](troubleshooting.md#replay-a-recorded-episode-on-the-physical-arm) and match its "
"calibration, start pose, joint order, units, and frame rate."
msgstr ""
"같은 robot에서 수집한 episode를 replay해 기록된 명령이 여전히 task를 재현하는지 확인합니다. Policy prediction을 우회하므로 큰 "
"calibration, joint mapping, gripper, timing, actuator 문제를 찾을 수 있습니다. [Recorded-episode replay "
"절차](troubleshooting.md#replay-a-recorded-episode-on-the-physical-arm)에 따라 calibration, 시작 pose, "
"joint 순서, 단위, frame rate를 맞추세요."

msgid "Test with known-good recorded observations."
msgstr "검증된 저장 Observation으로 시험"

msgid ""
"Feed saved camera images, robot state, and the task instruction through the checkpoint offline, "
"using its original preprocessing and action decoding. Compare the predictions with those from "
"live observations to help isolate camera, observation-timing, preprocessing, or policy-runtime "
"differences. See the [fixed-observation procedure](troubleshooting.md#test-policy-inputs-with-"
"fixed-or-dummy-observations)."
msgstr ""
"원래 preprocessing과 action decoding을 사용해 저장 camera image, robot state, task instruction을 "
"checkpoint에 offline 입력합니다. Live observation의 예측과 비교하면 camera, observation timing, preprocessing, "
"policy runtime 차이를 좁힐 수 있습니다. [Fixed-observation 절차](troubleshooting.md#test-policy-inputs-with-"
"fixed-or-dummy-observations)를 확인하세요."

msgid ""
"As an optional advanced test, a custom harness can apply those decoded actions to the robot. "
"Start from the recorded pose and supervise the motion: the saved observations no longer track "
"what the robot is doing. This can help check action execution, but it is a diagnostic, not a "
"policy-success trial. Record the observations, achieved starting pose, runtime revision, and "
"executed actions; a changed result alone does not establish the cause."
msgstr ""
"선택적인 고급 시험으로 custom harness가 decoded action을 robot에 적용할 수 있습니다. 기록된 pose에서 시작하고 움직임을 감독하세요. 저장 "
"observation은 현재 robot 상태를 반영하지 않습니다. Action 실행 진단에는 유용하지만 policy 성공 trial은 아닙니다. Observation, 실제 "
"시작 pose, runtime revision, 실행 action을 기록하세요. 결과가 바뀌었다는 사실만으로 원인이 입증되지는 않습니다."

msgid ""
"There is no single sim-to-real solution. It remains an active robotics research area with both "
"strong results and unresolved challenges. Learning to isolate hardware, observation, policy, "
"action, and environment failures helps you choose the next experiment instead of changing several"
" factors at once."
msgstr ""
"Sim-to-Real에 하나의 정답은 없습니다. 좋은 성과와 미해결 과제가 함께 있는 활발한 robotics 연구 분야입니다. Hardware, observation, "
"policy, action, environment의 실패를 분리해 진단하면 여러 요인을 한꺼번에 바꾸는 대신 다음 실험을 정할 수 있습니다."

msgid "What's Next?"
msgstr "다음 단계"

msgid "Continue to [Isaac GR00T: Vision-Language-Action Models](10-groot.md)."
msgstr "[Isaac GR00T: Vision-Language-Action Models](10-groot.md)로 이동하세요."

